            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima abantu baateeranira hamwe nk'omuntu omwe omu kubuga ekiri omu maisho g'eirembo ry'Amaizi, baagambira Ezera omuhandiiki kureeta ekitabo ky'Ebiragiro bya Musa, ebi Ruhanga yaahaire Abaisraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.23.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 23:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.31.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 31:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aha kiro ky'okubanza ky'okwezi kwa mushanju Ezera omunyamurwa yaareeta ekyo kitabo ky'Ebiragiro omu maisho g'omutwe gw'abashaija n'abakazi, boona abaabaire nibabaasa kuhurira, bakeetegyereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaashoma ebirimu, ayorekyeire ekibuga ekiri omu maisho g'eirembo ry'Amaizi, okwiha omu kasheeshe kare okuhitsya omu ihangwe, abashaija n'abakazi n'abandi abrikubaasa kwetegyereza bariho; kandi abantu boona baatega amatu kuhurira eby'omuri ekyo kitabo ky'Ebiragiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Ezera omuhandiiki yaayemerera aha kituuti ky'embaaho, eki baabaire bakozire ahabw'ogwo murimo; aha rubaju rwe rwa buryo haayemereraho Matisia, Sheema, Anaya, Uriya, Hilukia na Maaseya; n'aha rwa bumosho, Pedaaya, Mishaeli, Malikiya, Hashumu, Hashibadana, Zekaria na Meshulaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atyo Ezera yaashuuruurira ekitabo omu maisho g'abantu boona, ahakuba akaba ari ahatunguukire naabeeshumba; ku yaakishuurwire, abantu boona baayemerera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
