            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi Nehemia, owaabaire ari omutegyeki, na Ezera omunyamurwa kandi omuhandiiki, n'Abaleevi abaabaire nibeegyesa abantu, baagambira abantu boona bati: Eizooba eri n'eririkwera ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu; murekye kuganya, nari kurira. Ahabw'okuba abantu boona ku baahuriire ebigambo by'Ebiragiro, baarira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EST.9.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Est 9:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EST.9.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima yaabagira ati: Mwirooko murye ez'ebishaju, munywe ebirikunuriirira, mutwekyere abataine obabisiire egabo; ahakuba eri izooba n'eryereziibwe Mukama waitu; kandi murekye kushaasha, ahabw'eokuba okushemerererwa omuri MUKAMA nigo maani gaanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batyo Abaalevi baahunamya abantu boona nibagira bati: Mucureere, ahakuba eizooba eri n'eririkwera; murekye kushaasha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima abantu boona baayaabuuka, baaza kurya n'okunywa kandi n'okutwekyera bagyenzi baabo egabo, n'okushemererwa munonga, ahabw'okushoborokyerwa ebigambo ebi baagambirwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
