              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha kiro kya kabiri abakuru b'amaju ga baishenkuru ab'eihanga ryona, hamwe n'abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi, baateeranira ahari Ezera omuhandiiki kuhurira ebigambo by'omu Biragiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
